	quest.04ACC7E762537FB4.quest_desc: ["Place a raw ore block inside the Integrated Dynamics Squeezer and jump on it until it completes. Ore hammers then turn raw ore into dust for smelting, bridging sieving and powered machinery."]
	quest.04ACC7E762537FB4.quest_subtitle: "Squeeze and hammer your ores"
	quest.04ACC7E762537FB4.title: "&#00D4FF» &fManual Ore Processing &#00D4FF«"
	quest.04B68D8613E4A81F.quest_desc: ["The &b&lME Controller&r is the most important Block in all of &b&lAE2&r. The Heart of the &bME System&r. There is nothing in &b&lAE2&r without the &b&lME Controller&r. \\n\\nNow how do we make it? \\n\\nFirst and the simplest, is &bSky Stone&r. Just Smelt &bSky Stone Dust&r! \\n\\nNext is &5Fluix Dust&r. Check out the previous Quest in order to make it. \\n\\nLast is the &cEngineering Processor&r. This is made from using an &5&lInscriber&r to combine &cRedstone Dust&f, an &bEngineering Processor Circuit&f, and &8Printed Silicon&r!"]
	quest.04B68D8613E4A81F.title: "&5&lME Controller"
	quest.04B6E31120663EB2.quest_desc: ["Cultivate Slime as part of the Tier progression. Automate harvesting before expanding into the next resource group."]
	quest.04B6E31120663EB2.quest_subtitle: "Farming"
	quest.04B6E31120663EB2.title: "§d» §fSlime §5«"
