	quest.062AA943A1629A86.quest_desc: ["You blew up the &zRainbow Furnace&r?!?! Just lit TNT right next to it? Are you mad? That took so many Furnaces and resources and you just blew it up!!! Did you atleast get something good from it? &zRainbow Coal&r? Coal that lasts &mforever&r a long time? Actually that's pretty worth it."]
