		"&b◆ &fEntropy Industry &8• &7Digital Protocol"
		""
		"Uranium Fuel Rod Depleted belongs to the Entropy nuclear program. Prepare the full fuel cycle, isolate radioactive materials, and verify cooling and waste handling before continuous operation."
	]
