	quest.09BE81548CD81068.title: "&a»&r &fLarge Advanced Motor&a «"
	quest.09BF4A7F1C3426D4.quest_desc: ["&6&lGeOre&r are our main Automation for Resources with &b&lETZTTS&r. \\n\\nThey work like &5Budding Amethyst&r or &bCertus&r. Crystals will grow out of any side of them if there is room. \\n\\nThe only difference is that &6&lGeOres&r can be picked up by Pickaxes! Even without Silk Touch! \\n\\nThe Crystals can be Mined off of the &6Budding GeOre&r and can then be Smelt to get our Ingot. \\n\\nAny Blocks that boost the speed of &5Amethyst&r will also speed up &6GeOres&r."]
	quest.09BF4A7F1C3426D4.title: "&6&lGeOre"
	quest.09C31E71C56A3844.quest_desc: ["A useful item for progressing through this chapter."]
	quest.09C31E71C56A3844.quest_subtitle: "Item"
	quest.09C31E71C56A3844.title: "&a»&r &fWatercress&a «"
	quest.09D18512037386C1.quest_desc: ["In order to put Potion Effects into you'll need to fill a Potion Filter. \\n\\nTo do so: have a Potion Effect on you, then right click with the Potion Filter to remove it from you and add it to the Filter, and repeat until it's filled and active. \\n\\nThis also works with modded Potion Effects or ones you can't usually get through Potions like Haste or Resistance."]
	quest.09D18512037386C1.quest_subtitle: "Logistics upgrade"
	quest.09D18512037386C1.title: "&a»&r &fPotion Filter&a «"
	quest.09D2137B4F42006E.quest_desc: ["Eclipse Ember anchors this stage of the Entropy material chain. Eclipse Ember Form it by spreading Goo across Voidflame Coal Blocks using tier four goo. Eclipse Ember ore benefits from Fortune."]
