	quest.0B35172E47705205.quest_desc: ["Yes, &bIndustrial Foregoing&r has ore processing too. This one uses &6Liquid Meat&r to convert an ore into Raw Ore Meat. I'm not an ore doctor, so I can't exactly do anything with this Raw Ore Meat. Maybe give it to the Fermentation Station?"]
