	quest.109CB437DFAECDC6.quest_desc: [
		"The &aAlloy Smelter&r will be your most used machine in &eEnderIO&r as most Machines and Gizmos require some kind of Alloy produced here! oh and it can be upgraded with &bCapacitors&r."
		""
		"In the &aAlloy Smelter's&r interface, you can configure it in many different ways to improve your automation. It allows for side input/output configuration, redstone configuration, and swapping between three modes:"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&eAlloy only mode&f: Only allows the Alloy Smelter to create alloys."
		""
		"&eFurnace only mode&f: Treats the Alloy Smelter as a furnace"
		""
		"&eAlloying and Smelting&f: This mode will do both alloying and smelting, which can be bad when automating as some items will be smelted before turning into alloys."
	]
	quest.109CB437DFAECDC6.title: "§5» §dAlloy Smelter §5«"
	quest.10AA2B20D86747F7.quest_desc: ["Assemble &bFerricore Chestplate&r for &lLiving & Composite Armor&r. It provides alternative protection built from cultivated, flexible or unusual materials. Compare its protection, power cost and utility before replacing your current set."]
