	quest.123341C9AFD8E86A.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Sequenced Assembly Matrix&f automatically processes Filling, Deploying, and Sequenced Assembly recipes inside a one-block solution."
		""
		"Simply place the &6Matrix&f next to an &dAE2 Pattern Provider&f containing those recipe patterns and provide the &6Matrix&f with Stress and power (if applicable)."
		""
		"The more stress you provide it and the faster RPM you do it at, the quicker the &6Matrix&f will process recipes. It accepts Stress from the 2 sides that have a larger circle around the middle."
	]
	quest.123341C9AFD8E86A.title: "§6» §eSequenced Assembly Matrix §6«"
