	quest.12488A9A290B00DC.quest_desc: [
		"&eNot Enough Patterns' &3Sequenced Assembly Controller&f makes managing assembly sequences very easy. It automatically handles all item and fluid routing to their stations (energisers need to be powered separately)."
		""
		"Simply place the &3Controller&f near your assembly line and connect it to an &dAE2 Pattern Provider&f containing the pattern that relates to that assembly line."
		""
		"Then, using a &aSequenced Assembly Linker&f, Right-click to set that assembly line's input, output (must be a depot), and the machines in the correct processing order. Lastly, Right-click the &3Controller&f to store that configuration."
	]
	quest.12488A9A290B00DC.title: "§6» §eSequenced Assembly Controller §6«"
	quest.124CD4B8876B81F6.quest_desc: ["A sturdy block used for building or storage."]
	quest.124CD4B8876B81F6.quest_subtitle: "Store the power you generate"
	quest.124CD4B8876B81F6.title: "Storing Energy"
	quest.12512AAAF15B97C1.quest_desc: [
		"&2Time Fluid&f is used in the &dParadox Mixer&f, primarily used for the &zPina Colada&f craft."
		""
		"It can also be used to power &dBudding Time Crystals&f."
		""
		"You'll want to make the &6Echoing Budding Time Block&f once you're able to so that you can mass-produce &aTime Clusters&f. It requires &cEnergy&f and &2Time Fluid&f to run."
	]
	quest.12512AAAF15B97C1.title: "§b» §fEchoing Budding Time §3«"
	quest.1256F280F3669DDA.quest_desc: [
		"&lAbility Type:&r Active"
		""
		"&lAbility Function:&r"
		""
		"Makes Arrows chain to nearby enemies."
