	quest.128A1EEAF8F45042.quest_desc: ["Mycelium spores are an uncommon dirt-sieving result. Apply them to dirt or grass and let the mycelium spread; this strange soil powers the next fluid transformation."]
	quest.128A1EEAF8F45042.quest_subtitle: "Spore dirt for mushroom soil"
	quest.128A1EEAF8F45042.title: "&#EAB308» &fCultivating Mycelium &#EAB308«"
	quest.129E09C03E40BA57.quest_desc: ["The Reactor takes Awakened Draconium as Fuel, don't worry its efficient! Fuel Conversion determines when the Awakened Draconium will change to Chaos. It can take only 8 BLocks at a time and can only be Fueled or Refueled when the Reactor is shut off. SAS mode helps to make that easier! Also Fuel goes into the bottom right Slots."]
	quest.129E09C03E40BA57.title: "Fuel for our Reactor"
	quest.12B51282E82C1050.quest_desc: [
		"&e◆ &fEntropy Industry &8• &7Electric Protocol"
		""
		"Op Amp marks a required step in the Entropy electric industrial route. Complete it as part of a repeatable production chain instead of crafting only a single copy by hand."
	]
