		"&6◆ &fEntropy Industry &8• &7Steam Protocol"
		""
		"Steam Mining Drill is a strategic steam resource. Produce it in repeatable batches, keep a buffered stock, and route the line into storage before unlocking the next process."
	]
	quest.12FB3990CA1653A4.quest_subtitle: "Tool"
	quest.12FB3990CA1653A4.title: "&a»&r &fSteam Mining Drill&a «"
