	quest.17378FE70654852D.quest_desc: ["Infinity Cells continuously provide their configured resource while installed in an ME Drive. \\n\\nEntropy Zero does not allow these endgame cells to be assembled in a crafting grid. Start with the correct AE2 cell housing, then send it through a &6Create Sequenced Assembly&r line. \\n\\nSix Deployer stages install the compressed target resource, Quartz Glass, a 256M MEGA Storage Component and all three Allthemodium metals. A Mechanical Press seals the completed cell. The line remains expensive, but compact and fully automatable."]
	quest.17378FE70654852D.title: "&lInfinity ME Cells"
