	quest.1A8440C0048EEB02.quest_desc: ["Assemble &bBlazegold Chestplate&r for &lLiving & Composite Armor&r. It provides alternative protection built from cultivated, flexible or unusual materials. Compare its protection, power cost and utility before replacing your current set."]
