	quest.1F66CDC9799B5DEC.quest_desc: ["I found myself annoyed at being unable to rotate &bIndustrial Foregoing&r Machines with most Wrenches. To help with this, I have compiled a list of all the wrenches that I can find that are capable of rotating &bIF&r machines. These were tested primarily on the Laser Drill, so the results will focus primarily on that. Some wrenches might not work with other machines.\\n\\nClick the task in this quest to view all valid Wrenches for this quest."]
