		"&6◆ &fEntropy Industry &8• &7Steam Protocol"
		""
		"Steam Quarry is a key processing station in the Entropy steam production line. Give it dedicated inputs and outputs, keep one recipe running to build efficiency, then duplicate the line when throughput becomes the bottleneck."
	]
