	quest.22488BFDDB85DB29.quest_subtitle: "Power transport"
	quest.22488BFDDB85DB29.title: "&a»&r &fFluid Pipe&a «"
	quest.224C07AC71C5F40E.quest_desc: ["Applies &lBone Meal&r or &#8B4513Fertilizer&r to plants in its working area. This will continue applying &#8B4513Fertilizer&r to the same crop until that crop can no longer accept &lBone Meal&r before moving on to the next plant. This means that the machine can get stuck on plants that always accept &lBone Meal&r, such as &eSunflowers&r, or plants that never reach their final growth state.\\n\\nThis machine supports Range Addons."]
	quest.224CE21E56703F6E.quest_desc: ["A mystical item tied to this chapter's magic system."]
	quest.224CE21E56703F6E.quest_subtitle: "Magic item"
	quest.224CE21E56703F6E.title: "&a»&r &fWand&a «"
	quest.22572456571C3F8D.quest_desc: ["The &3Charging Module&r depressurizes any pressurizable things in containers it points at."]
	quest.225C6EB3287BC8A2.quest_desc: ["With our new-found &bElite Crafting Table&r we can use the 7x7 Grid to make &bCrystaltine Ingots&r! \\n\\nWe'll just need 10 &9Lapis Lazuli&r, 8 &bDiamonds&r, 4 &eGold&r, 4 &7Iron&r, and 2 Nether Stars to make 4 &bCrystaltine Ingots&r. \\n\\nThere is a specific pattern you need to use to Craft it."]
	quest.225C6EB3287BC8A2.title: "&bCrystaltine Ingot"
