	quest.22B83D03C6C3E61E.quest_desc: ["Install Machine Speed Addon only where it improves a real bottleneck. More speed usually increases power demand, so upgrade generation and transport first."]
	quest.22B83D03C6C3E61E.title: "§6» §eMachine Speed Addon §6«"
