	quest.2580135392DEF522.quest_desc: ["Ever feel like the standard Hydroponic Bed is too laggy? &mCan't fit enough Soul Surges?&r Oh right we don't have Soul Surges in this pack. Allow me to introduce the Simulated Hydroponic Bed. This will use a Hydroponic Simulation Processor and a seed/sapling to grow any crop of your choice...virtually. You don't even need &9Water&r and &bEther Gas&r for this one. On top of this, Hydroponic Simulation Processors get better over time as they grow more crops, though the rate at which it scales is slower in a Simulated Hydroponic Bed.\\n\\nDon't even bother trying to maximize the Processor. It will take an unfathomably long time. Much longer than what it would take for me to make the quests for Ender IO, for sure."]
	quest.2580135392DEF522.quest_subtitle: "HNN but for crops?"
	quest.2580135392DEF522.title: "Simulated Hydroponic Bed"
	quest.258531A2C52ED845.quest_desc: ["By the time you guys get the &6AllTheModium Nugget&r the new Chapter will be out already. \\n\\nOkay, that was underestimating you guys a lot and I know that isn't true. \\n\\nWe'll make a Chapter for &6&lAllTheModium&r soon though!"]
	quest.2588279A071E5A6B.quest_desc: ["Oritech can apply industrial control to mob spawning. Prepare a secure, powered area before building the Spawner Controller and its cage."]
