	quest.28408BFAA54E4FC6.quest_desc: ["Assemble &bLeather Chestplate&r for &lFirst Protection&r. It provides a reliable defensive checkpoint for the next stage of the island. Compare its protection, power cost and utility before replacing your current set."]
