	quest.2C2BF70590DBF943.quest_desc: ["The &aEnder Crafter&r is, despite looking like a Crafting Table, much different! \\n\\nCrafting it and the &aEnder Alternator&r is pretty simple. Crafting Table, &aEyes of Ender&r, and &2Ender Ingots&r. Those are just &aEnder Pearls&r and &7Iron&r. \\n\\nSpeaking of the &aAlternator&r, we will need one in a 7x7x7 Area with the &aEnder Crafter&r in the center.  "]
