	quest.31B58988AAB27E91.quest_desc: ["Build &bPromethium Pickaxe&r as part of &lEngineered Excavation&r. It supports powered and industrial alternatives to ordinary mining tools. Treat it as infrastructure: automate its materials before relying on it for repeated work."]
