	quest.339DF320DDCAD98B.quest_desc: ["Transporters can be used to transport Items and/or Fluids between inventories that are 1 block away. You need a Transporter in the extraction side and another in the insertion side. To change these modes, right click the middle area.\\n\\nYou can have multiple transporter types in the same block. You can upgrade these with Addons. Speed to increase transfer speed, Efficiency to increase transfer amount."]
