	quest.33B7C1D2A229EB5C.quest_desc: ["Ever wanted the ultimate Quantum Computer setup? Well, here's a setup for you, focused on maximizing co-processing threads.\\n\\n218 Quantum Computer Structural Glass, 123 Quantum Computer Accelerators, 1 Quantum Computer Core, and 1 Quantum Computer Multi-Threader are what we need. This gives us a total of 8928 co-processing threads. Note that I did not include any storage here besides the core, as the 256M crafting storage from the core is plenty enough already. The Data Entangler quest is optional for a reason.\\n\\nGet 200 Q.C. Structural Glass and 100 Q.C. Accelerators, and I'll give you the rest, because I'm just as generous as the Apothic Enchanting chapter."]
	quest.33B7C1D2A229EB5C.title: "The Ultimate Quantum Computer"
