	quest.35E666FB9EAFA39B.quest_desc: ["Let's Bake a Cake! An &dEnd Cake&r! \\n\\n2 cups of Sugar, 1 whole Egg, 3 &eCrushed Endstone&r? And 3 &3Eyes of Ender&r? \\n\\nI doubt the Cake will taste good with those ingredients! But it will Teleport you to &d&lThe End&r! \\n\\n&d&lThe End&r is perfectly normal to &2&lVanilla&r. I'd recommend taking a &8Waystone&r so you can Teleport between each much easier."]
	quest.35E666FB9EAFA39B.title: "Getting to &d&lThe End"
