	quest.380B8D81C687FF68.quest_desc: ["Sieve &eCrushed End Stone&r to obtain &dUnobtainium Nuggets&r. A &bDiamond Mesh&r has a &e1%&r base chance per block; a &8Netherite Mesh&r improves it to &e2%&r. Each successful roll yields one nugget. Automate crushing and sieving for a steady supply, then combine nine nuggets into an ingot. Check &eJEI&r for the recipes."]
