	quest.38256909C87DCD36.quest_desc: ["&dAllTheArcanist Gear&r is created similar to &6AllTheModium&r, just instead of Upgrading &cNetherite&r, you'll Upgrade the &2Geo&f/Aether/&bAqua&f/&cPyro&r-mancer &dGear&r. \\n\\nThese will give 24 Armor Points but only 16 Armor Toughness and no Knockback Resistance. \\n\\nIt makes up for it by giving more Max Mana, Mana Regen, and Spell Power!\\n\\nIt also carries almost all of the extra buffs &6AllTheModium Armor&r offers."]
