	quest.415FB6154BA6209B.quest_desc: [
		"The &3Blaze Burner&r is used to generate heat for things like &cSteam Engines&r and other heat-related mods like &ePNCR&r."
		""
		"You'll first need to craft an &aEmpty Blaze Burner&f, then go to the nether and Right-click a &cBlaze&f with the &aEmpty Blaze Burner&f to capture it."
		""
		"Once that's done you're able to place down your &3Blaze Burner&f and feed it items or fluids, causing it to generate heat."
	]
	quest.415FB6154BA6209B.title: "§6» §eEmpty Blaze Burner §6«"
