	quest.418E0A23EC74F320.title: "&a»&r &fCentrifuge Block&a «"
	quest.418E57E34FFC19E1.quest_desc: ["The Ore Laser Base is &bIndustrial Foregoing&r's Void Miner, being able to conjure ores out of thin air. Lens allow you to favor a specific color of ore, such as Blue for Lapis.\\n\\nThe Fluid Laser Base produces Fluids out of either thin air or from specific mobs. These require you to use specific Lens. Mobs that are used to produce Fluids will take damage, so using a Stasis Chamber for it is recommended.\\n\\nLaser Drills provide progress to the Laser Base in its working area."]
	quest.418E57E34FFC19E1.quest_subtitle: "Void Miner"
	quest.418E57E34FFC19E1.title: "Laser Drill"
	quest.4194397DFD0199C2.quest_desc: ["A useful item for progressing through this chapter."]
	quest.4194397DFD0199C2.quest_subtitle: "Item"
