	quest.41E8550FC36ABCA5.quest_desc: ["Infinity Tools, so called because of their ability to be charged near-infinitely. Increasing the tier of the tool can give said tool special perks. Having &5Biofuel&r in them will make them more efficient, by consuming the fuel instead of power when used.\\n\\nThere are 7 tiers:\\nPoor\\nCommon\\nUncommon\\nRare\\nEpic\\nLegendary\\nArtifact\\n\\nTo learn more about each Infinity Tool, check out Industrial Foregoing's Manual (so that I don't have to cover so many infinity tools in one quest)!"]
	quest.41E8550FC36ABCA5.title: "Infinity Tools"
	quest.41E8C93A44559E48.quest_desc: ["The &7Paradox Machine&r can, for a price of a lot of Power and &aTime Fluid&r, take a Snapshot of blocks and entities in the designated area; then it can duplicate it. \\n\\nLots of Blocks and Entities are blacklisted by configs so no duplicating Bees!"]
