	quest.4AB5FA0A45F9EB92.quest_desc: ["&7Obtain your first token, then search &dEntropy Token&r in JEI. The Vault offers Omega Upgrades, Antimatter, Quantum technology, a Dimension Card, Chaotic power and other premium upgrades.\n\n&cTokens are finite:&r every purchase matters."]
