	quest.52DD11BC71F45E32.quest_desc: [
		"Place leaves inside an &bOak Crucible&r and let them turn into water."
		""
		"First craft a regular &fIron Bucket&r using &e3 Iron Ingots&r. Obtain iron through sieving and process the drops into ingots; check JEI for the required mesh and processing recipes."
		""
		"Once the crucible contains &b1,000 mB&r of water, right-click it with the empty iron bucket. Then right-click an empty &6Ex Deorum Barrel&r with the filled bucket."
		""
		"You do not need a clay bucket to obtain your first clay. Rain can also fill an uncovered barrel directly."
	]
	quest.52DD11BC71F45E32.quest_subtitle: "Compost leaves for water"
	quest.52DD11BC71F45E32.title: "&#38BDF8» &fWater from Leaves &#38BDF8«"
	quest.52E59FCB39D66BCF.quest_desc: ["One of the best options for \"Passive Power\", the &9Thermal Generator&r will produce FE when placed over a &cHeat Source&r and given a steady supply of water.\\n\\nThere are currently 3 blocks you can place this over: a Magma block which produces the lowest, a lava source block which is a little better, or a &cBlock of Blazing Crystal&r, which provides the most heat. "]
