	quest.55E56A748C8681AC.quest_desc: ["The specialized Infinity Cells include &7Clay&r, &0Kivi&r, &bSky Stone&r and &3Ancient Stone&r. \\n\\nEach one uses its own compressed resource as the first Deployer stage. This selects the correct assembly automatically, so several cell recipes can safely share the same production line."]
