	quest.5C83D5CDD980FD9A.quest_desc: ["Assemble &bSnout Armor Trim Smithing Template&r for &lModular Defense&r. It provides customization that adapts existing equipment to a specific threat. Compare its protection, power cost and utility before replacing your current set."]
