	quest.5E24012A3D9B72A1.quest_desc: [
		"Items are not the only things that can be stored in ME cells. &bME Fluid Storage Cells&f can store liquids such as water, lava and any variety of modded oils and fuels, just to give a few examples. "
		""
		"Note that all storage cells, regardless of what they're designed to store, only differ in terms of their housing; both item and fluid cells use the same kind of storage component to make. "
		""
		"For fluids, 1 byte equals 8 buckets (8000mb)."
	]
	quest.5E2A8D71C6904F3B.quest_desc: ["Place an &6Allthemodium Ingot&r in the centre. On the pedestals, place one &5Unobtainium Ingot&r, one &bSource Gem Block&r, one &dArcane Crystal Dust&r and one &dEnd Crystal&r.\n\nCost: &b10,000 Source&r. Output: &ax2 Allthemodium–Unobtainium Alloy Ingots&r. Supply the ingredients and Source to let a Wixie automate the entire cycle."]
	quest.5E2A8D71C6904F3B.quest_subtitle: "10,000 Source • Produces 2"
	quest.5E2A8D71C6904F3B.title: "&#EC4899» &fAllthemodium–Unobtainium Alloy &#EC4899«"
