	quest.65A529C8238E89F1.quest_desc: ["Assemble &bLapis Lazuli Chestplate&r for &lIndustrial Armor&r. It provides powered protection built for factories and hazardous engineering. Compare its protection, power cost and utility before replacing your current set."]
