	quest.65E733AACBE62EDB.quest_desc: ["Assemble &bWard Armor Trim Smithing Template&r for &lModular Defense&r. It provides customization that adapts existing equipment to a specific threat. Compare its protection, power cost and utility before replacing your current set."]
