	quest.6601450C63FEEE61.quest_desc: ["Build &bDiamond&r as part of &lMaterial Foundations&r. It supports the material checkpoints that unlock stronger equipment. Treat it as infrastructure: automate its materials before relying on it for repeated work."]
	quest.6601450C63FEEE61.quest_subtitle: "Raw material"
	quest.6601450C63FEEE61.title: "&#F2C96D» &fDiamond &#F2C96D«"
	quest.6601ACCDDF6CA5FF.quest_desc: ["The Reactor can only hold 1 Billion OP and while that may seem like a far number, it won't be for long. When Energy Saturation reaches 100%% it will increase Heat a ton which can lead to Meltdown. It will need 500,000,000 OP to activate and a Flux Gate will help limit how much OP comes in and out. (BTW 1 RF = 1 OP) They need Redstone to activate and can be used for both adding OP and taking out OP. You'll need Energy out to not Meltdown, try putting it in an Energy Core!"]
	quest.6601ACCDDF6CA5FF.title: "A jump start"
	quest.660EFAF144F70749.quest_desc: ["The &eMV Steam Turbine&r converts steam or another working fluid into electrical power for the factory network. This is a key Electric Era automation milestone."]
	quest.660EFAF144F70749.title: "&b» &fMV Steam Turbine &b«"
	quest.661489455FA28131.quest_desc: ["A useful item for progressing through this chapter."]
