	quest.6ADDFD55AD0DF7D4.title: "&a»&r &fInanite Ingot&a «"
	quest.6ADE6F9E004055F7.quest_desc: [
		"Time Crystals are a new material added by JDT. These grow on Budding Time Crystal Blocks, which are created by performing goo spread on Budding Amethyst or a Time Crystal Block.\\n\\nHOWEVER, the Budding Time Crystal Block must collect time from the Overworld, the Nether, and The End to be able to grow Time Crystal Clusters. You CANNOT break or use silk touch on the Budding Time Crystal Block. You must use a Swapper, Cardboard Box, or Cut Paste Gadget to move them.\\n\\nAfter a while, the Budding Time Crystal Block will run out of energy, and must go for another trip to the Overworld, Nether, and End."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"To automate this process, look at the video linked in the image above this quest."
	]
	quest.6ADE6F9E004055F7.quest_subtitle: "Timey Wimey"
