	quest.6B04292F127FC8CB.quest_desc: ["The &3Vibranium Armor Set&r has even better stats than &6AllTheModium&r. \\n\\nWe get 32 Armor Points, 36 Armor Toughness, and 80% Knockback Resistance!\\n\\nUnfortunately we don't get new effects and abilities... but we get more &dMagic Damage Resistance&r! Now at 75%!"]
