	quest.6B2027DA7AA6FF34.quest_desc: ["&9Powah&r is a tech mod that's all about generating, storing, and transmitting &dPower&r. Ranging from basic FE generation to &aReactors&r that produce &b250k FE/t&r, Powah has you covered!\\n\\nTo get started, get some &aUraninite&r!"]
