	quest.6C001E18093FC037.quest_desc: ["The Plant Gatherer harvests plants in its working area. Harvested plants can give &#5919B6Sludge&r, which can be used in a Sludge Refiner. When supplied with &bEther Gas&r, the Plant Gatherer will automatically replant crops.\\n\\nThe Plant Sower automatically plants crops and saplings. It has 9 color coded inventory slots, which correspond to the colored markings on top of the Plant Sower. The working area of the machine is divided into 9 segments, which correspond to the various inventory slots.\\n\\nBoth of these machines support Range Addons."]
	quest.6C001E18093FC037.title: "Plants"
