	quest.6D8A3F29C1B047E5.quest_desc: ["The three ultimate alloys are now forged through an &5Ars Nouveau Enchanting Apparatus&r. Place the main ingot in the centre and the four ingredients on Arcane Pedestals. Keep the area supplied with Source.\n\nThis process is designed for automation: a &dWixie&r can operate the Apparatus and move the ingredients for you once a stable Source network is connected."]
