	quest.73EA0CFA78C689F2.quest_desc: ["Certain saplings are normally found in loot chests in various structures. Of course, being a skyblock pack, we don't really have those structures. So how do we get those saplings, then? Backpacks?\\n\\nI've got a better answer, the Ender Crafter.\\n\\nCheck out the Ender Crafter quest in Chapter 3 for more information on how to use it.\\n\\nWait did I give you the wrong Alternator as a quest reward...oops..."]
