	quest.74AE214747A3DB1A.quest_desc: ["Increases how much pressure things can hold."]
	quest.74AE214747A3DB1A.quest_subtitle: "Turn it up!"
	quest.74B2E9C45A1D308F.quest_desc: ["Place an &6Allthemodium Ingot&r in the centre. On the pedestals, place one &3Vibranium Ingot&r, two &bSource Gems&r and one &dArcane Crystal Dust&r.\n\nCost: &b5,000 Source&r. Output: &ax2 Allthemodium–Vibranium Alloy Ingots&r. A Wixie can repeat this ritual automatically."]
	quest.74B2E9C45A1D308F.quest_subtitle: "5,000 Source • Produces 2"
	quest.74B2E9C45A1D308F.title: "&#FFD700» &fAllthemodium–Vibranium Alloy &#FFD700«"
	quest.74C5FDC3B1E74586.quest_desc: ["Install the &eQuantum Upgrade&r to push compatible machines beyond their base limits. Upgrade power delivery before increasing operating speed."]
	quest.74C5FDC3B1E74586.title: "&d» &fQuantum Upgrade &d«"
	quest.74C6A31F7D3E15CF.quest_desc: ["Wait, why did it make &7Enriched Iron&r? \\n\\nOh, we just need to &9Infuse&r the &7Enriched Iron&r with &0Coal&r as well. This will give us &8Steel Dust&r! \\n\\nSmelt the &8Steel Dust&r and we'll finally have &8Steel Ingots&r. \\n\\nI think you are ready to take on &5&lMekanism&r then!"]
	quest.74C6A31F7D3E15CF.title: "&5&lMekanism"
	quest.74C715F8F24B8BAE.quest_desc: ["Same deal but with options of filtering."]
	quest.74C715F8F24B8BAE.title: "Filterable Ender Collection Module"
	quest.74CD3FC35F245DF2.quest_subtitle: "Blue Yonder + Flickering Sun"
	quest.74CEF0D801DEE219.quest_desc: ["Once the &c&lFoundry&r is smoking and our Materials are melting, we'll need a place to put it in order to make our &6GeOres&r! \\n\\nThe &8Casting Basin&r will be perfect as we need to Cast a full Block's worth of Ingot into &e1 Compressed Sand&r in order to make a &6GeOre&r. \\n\\nPlace the &eCompressed Sand&r into the &8Basin&r, then use the &7Tap&r on a &bDrain&r above the &8Basin&r to deliver the Material into it. \\n\\nWait a second to let it cool off and we should now have our..."]
	quest.74FA25B2E087BEC4.quest_desc: ["A mold used to cast metal into a specific shape."]
	quest.74FA25B2E087BEC4.quest_subtitle: "Casting mold"
	quest.74FA25B2E087BEC4.title: "&a»&r &fRing Cast&a «"
	quest.74FC0DDDB91DB172.quest_desc: ["To make life that much easier, AE2 provides a whole suite of devices for the manipulation of ME data, i.e. moving stored items around the world.\\n\\nThe &bME Interface&f is one of these devices. As an input device, the Interface allows any item/fluid/etc to be piped externally through it, which is then automatically stored in the ME Network that the interface is connected to.\\n\\nAs an output device, the Interface can be configured to keep a certain available amount of a stored item in stock, from the ME network to its own internal inventory. This allows items to then be received by some external source like another player or some pipe."]
	quest.74FC0DDDB91DB172.quest_subtitle: "OI, OI, OI!"
	quest.74FC0DDDB91DB172.title: "The IO"
