	quest.768973710C811CB1.quest_desc: ["Acquire the &eNano Quantum Helmet&r to complete this Quantum Era milestone. Check its recipes and automate the required materials before moving deeper into the chapter."]
	quest.768973710C811CB1.title: "&d» &fNano Quantum Helmet &d«"
	quest.768C07D1B5EB1FEB.quest_desc: ["These can be found in Suspicious Sand and Gravel inside Cold Ocean Ruins. We don't really have Cold Ocean Ruins here, so Alakarkinos will have to fill in. Just place some Gravel near their home, and some Source so they can work."]
	quest.768C07D1B5EB1FEB.quest_subtitle: "Cold Ocean Ruin Sus Blocks"
	quest.76A0592F4C294545.quest_desc: ["The Sawmill cuts Logs into Sawdust and more Planks than you would get from crafting. Sawdust can be used to make Paper.\\n\\n - Fustic Logs will also give you Fustic.\\n - Brazilwood Logs and Logwood Logs will also give you Haematoxylin."]
	quest.76A0592F4C294545.quest_subtitle: "I Wood too"
	quest.76A0592F4C294545.title: "Sawing"
	quest.76AFD59E30B8BA03.quest_desc: ["A checkpoint marking your progress through this chapter."]
	quest.76AFD59E30B8BA03.quest_subtitle: "Checkpoint"
	quest.76AFD59E30B8BA03.title: "&a»&r &fCheckpoint&a «"
	quest.76B1C5AFC5D6B7CF.quest_desc: ["The Time Wand can be used to accelerate blocks, similarly to the Time in a Bottle, up to x256 speed. Unlike TIAB, it uses FE and Time Fluid rather than stored time as fuel, making it considerably easier to refill.\\n\\nIt is blacklisted for fake players, though. We don't want you automating THIS."]
	quest.76B1C5AFC5D6B7CF.quest_subtitle: "Cousin of the Time in a Bottle"
	quest.76B5E884D18F5A7B.quest_desc: ["I don't care how you get them! Just get them! \\n\\nYou can use an Engineer's Hammer to Craft 1 Iron Ingot into 1 Iron Plate at the cost of Durability. \\n\\nYou can use a Forge Hammer which can turn 2 Iron Ingots into 1 Plate, or if you add in an &8&lMI&r Hammer it will only need 1 Ingot. \\n\\nHeck, even &6&lRailCraft&r gives us the Manual Rolling Machine but that can only turn 4 Iron Ingots into 4 Iron Plates."]
	quest.76B5E884D18F5A7B.title: "Iron Plates"
