	quest.7A458905051A6311.quest_desc: ["Build Ex Pattern Provider and integrate it into the appropriate ME subsystem. Keep the network modular so later upgrades remain easy to automate."]
	quest.7A458905051A6311.title: "§b» §fEx Pattern Provider §3«"
	quest.7A4ABFCD12202A91.quest_desc: ["Operational Potential is the Energy source of Draconic Evolution. The main way (not the only way) of moving OP is with IO Relay Crystals. To actually get OP into items you'll need an Energy Transfer."]
	quest.7A4ABFCD12202A91.title: "What is Energy or as we call it, OP?"
	quest.7A615E2A152917AD.quest_desc: ["For this you need 2 &5Netherite Furnaces&r and 7 pieces of glass which are each the color of the Rainbow. &cRed&r, &6Orange&r, &eYellow&r, &2Green&r, &3Blue&r, &9Indig&r- &5Purple&r, and &5Vi&r-&dMagenta&r. Yep! The whole Roy G. Bpm!"]
	quest.7A615E2A152917AD.title: "&zRainbow Core"
	quest.7A667314A54E6340.quest_desc: ["Build Fluix Smart Dense Cable and integrate it into the appropriate ME subsystem. Keep the network modular so later upgrades remain easy to automate."]
	quest.7A667314A54E6340.title: "§b» §fFluix Smart Dense Cable §3«"
	quest.7A7D7227BECE21B6.quest_desc: ["The &5&lInscriber&r is a Machine used in &b&lAE2&r, which will unfortunately need Energy to work... \\n\\nBut if we do have Energy to spare we can use it to transform Items! \\n\\nFrom Ingots and Crystals to Dust, to combining Circuits! \\n\\nTo use it, place Items in the 3 Slots on the Left and if there is Energy (and a correct Recipe) then our Product will end up on the Right."]
	quest.7A7D7227BECE21B6.title: "&5&lInscriber"
	quest.7A873E48E38B5C0E.quest_desc: [
		"&6◆ &fEntropy Industry &8• &7Steam Protocol"
		""
		"Checkpoint marks a required step in the Entropy steam industrial route. Complete it as part of a repeatable production chain instead of crafting only a single copy by hand."
	]
	quest.7A873E48E38B5C0E.quest_subtitle: "Checkpoint"
	quest.7A873E48E38B5C0E.title: "&a»&r &fCheckpoint&a «"
