	quest.7B08D4FC6F1B0005.quest_desc: [
		"Your first clay does not require a clay bucket. Start with a regular &fIron Bucket&r crafted from &e3 Iron Ingots&r obtained by sieving and processing the iron drops."
		""
		"&e1.&r Produce water from leaves in an &bOak Crucible&r. Right-click the crucible with your iron bucket to collect a full bucket of water."
		"&e2.&r Right-click an empty &6Ex Deorum Barrel&r with the water bucket."
		"&e3.&r Use an Ex Deorum hammer: cobblestone becomes gravel, gravel becomes sand, and sand becomes &fDust&r."
		"&e4.&r Hold the Dust block and right-click the water-filled barrel. Collect the resulting &6Clay&r from the barrel."
		""
		"&bWater + Dust = Clay&r. Dust is produced with the hammer, not with water."
		""
		"Alternatively, let rain fill an uncovered barrel before adding Dust. You can then use the clay for porcelain crafting."
	]
	quest.7B08D4FC6F1B0005.quest_subtitle: "Mix dust with water in barrel"
	quest.7B08D4FC6F1B0005.title: "&#F97316» &fClay from Dust &#F97316«"
