	quest.7CB4D47ABC295B92.quest_desc: ["It brews potions. Much like a standard Brewing Stand, it requires Blaze Powder as fuel, and uses bottles. Unlike a Brewing Stand, though, it can autofill those bottles with water.\\n\\nUnlike with other quests where I give a brief overview of the machine, I will provide a setup in another quest to automate this machine, as it is fairly janky and unintuitive in some areas."]
